    "detailed_description": "Create your playstyle using the 8 weapons, 18 spells, and 6 elemental enhancements. Weapons dictate whether you play close, at ranged, defensively, fast, slow, etc. Spells consist of three types: active, passive, and passive(with cooldown). They have many offensive and defensive capabilities but they also have more specialized uses such as platforming. Enhancements cover 4 types of play damage, sustain, defense, mobility. You can max in one type or spread out.<br><br>Visit towns to learn what the past holds by uncovering knowledge from books you collect and translate. <br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[Customizable way of kicking ass.Make choices to change the result but not the story.Passively or actively collect books to learn about the world.]</ul>",
